# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the live macros over a held chord (C: C3 G3 E4 B4), each swept
# in detents of 10 from 0 down to -100, up to 100 and back, on a still sound (no Swell, Drift, filter LFOs or detune,
# so what moves is the macro); then Space's tail, the drones stopped at -100, 0, 100.
# Not a test of its own.
page 0
notips
set 55 0
set 52 0
set 17 0
set 38 0
set 4 0
set 25 0
tap PLAY
wait 2000
chord 0 4800 700
chord 1 6400 700
chordgo 1 100
wait 2000
wav live-dark.wav
wait 3000
